      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wilson_Creek%2C_Washington"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Wilson Creek serves as the unofficial gateway to the dramatic Channeled Scablands of the Columbia Basin.",
